    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/14be2c55eabdb926c55d3abb20bc2318.poster.avif?t=1752845358\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/14be2c55eabdb926c55d3abb20bc2318.webm?t=1752845358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/14be2c55eabdb926c55d3abb20bc2318.mp4?t=1752845358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minimalist-style flight shooting game where your mission is to pilot a spaceship deep underground to detonate a nuclear bomb at the planet's core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sacrifice has its value. The ores collected during your missions can be used to upgrade and modify the next spaceship until you defeat the planet's ultimate Boss and destroy the entire planet.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/14be2c55eabdb926c55d3abb20bc2318.poster.avif?t=1752845358\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/14be2c55eabdb926c55d3abb20bc2318.webm?t=1752845358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/14be2c55eabdb926c55d3abb20bc2318.mp4?t=1752845358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minimalist-style flight shooting game where your mission is to pilot a spaceship deep underground to detonate a nuclear bomb at the planet's core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sacrifice has its value. The ores collected during your missions can be used to upgrade and modify the next spaceship until you defeat the planet's ultimate Boss and destroy the entire planet.</p>",
    "short_description": "\u300aHell Drop\u300b is a light rogue-like modular flight shooter game. You need to pilot a spaceship into the Zerg planet, break through the crust and their defenses, and detonate a bomb to complete the mission.",
